    <briefdescription>
<para>This class represents the number of cycles per resource (fractions of cycles). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>That quantity is managed here as a ratio, and accessed via the double cast-operator below. The two quantities, number of cycles and number of resources, are kept separate. This is used by the ResourcePressureView to calculate the average resource cycles per instruction/iteration. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
